    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redline is an arcade style, zero gravity racer focused on extreme speed and precision with easy to pick up but hard to master gameplay. Race solo against A.I or against friends in up to four player splitscreen! Drive into your opponents redline to steal their speed and decimate the competition!\u00a0<br><br><strong>Use the redline</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race in your opponent\u2019s redline to absorb it\u2019s energy and gain limit breaking boosts.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use evasive driving to keep your opponent\u2019s out of your redline.\u00a0<br><br><strong>High speed, high precision racing</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race at speeds in excess of 1000 kph, using precision two joystick steering.\u00a0<br><br><strong>Zero gravity racing through a dense and vast metropolis</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race upside down, through corkscrews, and up the side of vast skyscrapers on a track that takes you from the dense undercity to the clouds and back.\u00a0<br><br><strong>Race with a variety of ships and speed classes, on your own, or with friends</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your speed class, pick your ship, and race in up to 4 player split screen, or on your own in 8 player races.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redline is an arcade style, zero gravity racer focused on extreme speed and precision with easy to pick up but hard to master gameplay. Race solo against A.I or against friends in up to four player splitscreen! Drive into your opponents redline to steal their speed and decimate the competition!\u00a0<br><br><strong>Use the redline</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race in your opponent\u2019s redline to absorb it\u2019s energy and gain limit breaking boosts.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use evasive driving to keep your opponent\u2019s out of your redline.\u00a0<br><br><strong>High speed, high precision racing</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race at speeds in excess of 1000 kph, using precision two joystick steering.\u00a0<br><br><strong>Zero gravity racing through a dense and vast metropolis</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race upside down, through corkscrews, and up the side of vast skyscrapers on a track that takes you from the dense undercity to the clouds and back.\u00a0<br><br><strong>Race with a variety of ships and speed classes, on your own, or with friends</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your speed class, pick your ship, and race in up to 4 player split screen, or on your own in 8 player races.\u00a0</p>",
